-id = "ubs-aem-naming-prefix"
-title = "Component names carry their type's UBS prefix"
-output_formats = ["aem-ubs"]
-description = """
-Every component a form author names starts its `name` with the prefix UBS assigns to its type,
-followed by `_`: `PN_` for a panel, `RCP_` for a repeatable, `TXT_` for a text field (`TXTM_`
-multiline, `EML_` email, `TEL_` telephone), `NB_` number, `DATE_` date, `DD_` dropdown, `CB_`
-checkbox, `RB_` radio button, `TTL_` title, `ST_` (or `ITXT_`, `ETXT_`) static text, and `TBL_`,
-`CRT_` or `IMG_` for an HTML component showing a table, chart or image. A panel inside a
-repeatable may also use the repeatable family (`RCP_`, `RCHP_`, `RCBP_`, `RCHT_`).
-
-Fragments, the preface and footnote placeholders, message boxes and
-the profile's own fixed panels are named by the profile and are not checked. Only the prefix
-is checked; the rest of the name is free.
-
-Rename the node. A panel's name is also what conditions target (`target_panel_name`), so rename
-those references with it.
-"""
